# a first look and listen: the Tine layout in C, a run up the V, every page
# (params: 0 Material 1 Hardness 2 Decay 3 Tone 4 Body 5 Buzz 6 Wah 7 Wah rate 8 Reverb 9 Size 10 Delay
#  11 Time 12 Grains 13 Grain ms 14 Density 15 Pitch 16 Layout 17 Scale 18 Key 19 Black 20 Feedback
#  21 Spray 22 Strum 23 Release 24 Tune 25 MIDI ch 26 MIDI out 27 Width 28 Octave)
wav first.wav
wait 300
shot home.png
expect view 0
expect white8 6000
expect white7 6200
expect white9 6400
expect white15 8400
# the middle out, alternating sides: C D E F G A B C
tapkey w8
tapkey w7
tapkey w9
tapkey w6
tapkey w10
tapkey w5
tapkey w11
tapkey w4
wait 50
shot ringing.png
expect tine7200 >10
expect voices >5
leds
wait 2500
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
expect peak_db_min -30
# the pages, by their buttons; a button pressed again shows its next page, and round
# (0 Tine 1 Character | 2 Body | 3 Space 4 Color | 5 Grain 6 Spread | 7 Keys 8 Play | 9 Pattern | 10 Setup)
tap HOME
expect view 1
wait 50
shot character.png
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap ENV
expect view 2
shot body.png
tap FX
expect view 3
shot space.png
tap FX
expect view 4
wait 50
shot color.png
tap FX
expect view 3
tap LFO
expect view 5
shot grain.png
tap LFO
expect view 6
wait 50
shot spread.png
tap SEL
expect view 7
shot keys.png
tap SEL
expect view 8
wait 50
shot play.png
tap SEQ
expect view 9
wait 50
shot pattern.png
tap GLO
expect view 10
shot setup.png
# EDIT: every page in turn, and round
tap EDIT
expect view 0
tap EDIT
expect view 1
# ARP held: the Pattern page, and the pattern left as it was
press ARP
wait 700
release ARP
expect view 9
expect pat 0
tap GLO
# the encoders: SELECT material, ALGORITHM scale, PRESETS key
turn SELECT 2
expect par0 2
turn ALGO 2
expect par17 2
turn PRESET 3
expect par18 3
expect white8 6300
turn PRESET -4
expect par18 11
# B, pentatonic: the middle tine B3 (the octave starts at C4)
expect white8 5900
tap OCT-
expect par28 -1
expect white8 4700
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect par28 1
# knobs on the Tine page
tap GLO
tap HOME
expect view 0
spin K2 -20
expect par1 25
spin K3 30
expect par2 80
wait 50
shot knobs.png
expect dirty 1
